{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059820/extras/a1d41210859e029d7d084fbf32d149b2.avif?t=1760156091\" width=616 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cat carried Butterfly</strong> is a Chinese folklore-inspired narrative mystery game, told through the lens of Shanghai dialect, retelling strange tales from a century ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raised in an orphanage, L\u00fcp\u00edng returns to her childhood home. While uncovering her past, she unravels a mystery entwined with old customs and new ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059820/extras/87c6d5ab975c2b8172521d0516909b1e.avif?t=1760156091\" width=600 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong>Drawn from authentic historical backgrounds of early 20th-century Shanghai\u2014a time when the remnants of feudalism clashed with modern thought\u2014this is the tale of a girl searching for her identity, and of ordinary lives hidden in the alleys, burdened with sorrow and fleeting joy. The tide of history struck each individual like a great wave; may fate pass us by.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059820/extras/f00bd5f648ea88f2c2abb9db54603adb.avif?t=1760156091\" width=600 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will follow L\u00fcp\u00edng\u2019s perspective as she returns to her former residence, <strong>Luchang Lane</strong>. Within the overlap of reality and illusion, she reunites with the bygone souls of the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cat, a rat, humans, spirits, and specters\u2014each harboring riddles of their own. The courtyard and alleys hold the scars and obsessions of everyone who once lived there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059820/extras/34122d5271ef95d2b978be098f1265a9.avif?t=1760156091\" width=600 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring hand-drawn, retro pixel art. From the intoxicating glamour of \u201cGreater Shanghai\u201d to the shadows of its slums, the game paints an authentic portrait of the city\u2019s historic past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Performed by local Shanghai actors, the dialect\u2019s lilting tones echo like whispers from the depths of the courtyards, sketching fragments of bygone tales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059820/extras/cb8313942baa147a16422633e9a18327.avif?t=1760156091\" width=600 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles are like piecing together lost fragments. Through searching old belongings and listening to hushed voices, the story quietly takes shape. No demanding brain-teasers\u2014just a haunting journey into the uncanny past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>In the demo, you will enter Luchang Apartment in advance and experience the beginning of the story.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The full version will feature the complete storyline.</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4059820?t=1760156091","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059820/0eb8c296345e52f06125bbaad7d1bcb89208db32/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760156091","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059820/0b3b4654ddb7c7dfc5483692ed388cedd55bad3d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760156091","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059820/0b3b4654ddb7c7dfc5483692ed388cedd55bad3d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760156091","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>DEMO OUT NOW</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u00a0host\u00a0community\u00a0events,\u00a0and\u00a0share\u00a0upcoming\u00a0playtests\u00a0and\u00a0updates\u00a0in\u00a0our\u00a0official\u00a0Discord\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >channel.\u00a0Join\u00a0now\u00a0to\u00a0be\u00a0the\u00a0first\u00a0to\u00a0get\u00a0notified!</p></p><br><h1>About the Demo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059820/extras/a1d41210859e029d7d084fbf32d149b2.avif?t=1760156091\" width=616 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cat carried Butterfly</strong> is a Chinese folklore-inspired narrative mystery game, told through the lens of Shanghai dialect, retelling strange tales from a century ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raised in an orphanage, L\u00fcp\u00edng returns to her childhood home. While uncovering her past, she unravels a mystery entwined with old customs and new ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059820/extras/87c6d5ab975c2b8172521d0516909b1e.avif?t=1760156091\" width=600 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong>Drawn from authentic historical backgrounds of early 20th-century Shanghai\u2014a time when the remnants of feudalism clashed with modern thought\u2014this is the tale of a girl searching for her identity, and of ordinary lives hidden in the alleys, burdened with sorrow and fleeting joy. The tide of history struck each individual like a great wave; may fate pass us by.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059820/extras/f00bd5f648ea88f2c2abb9db54603adb.avif?t=1760156091\" width=600 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will follow L\u00fcp\u00edng\u2019s perspective as she returns to her former residence, <strong>Luchang Lane</strong>. Within the overlap of reality and illusion, she reunites with the bygone souls of the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cat, a rat, humans, spirits, and specters\u2014each harboring riddles of their own. The courtyard and alleys hold the scars and obsessions of everyone who once lived there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059820/extras/34122d5271ef95d2b978be098f1265a9.avif?t=1760156091\" width=600 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring hand-drawn, retro pixel art. From the intoxicating glamour of \u201cGreater Shanghai\u201d to the shadows of its slums, the game paints an authentic portrait of the city\u2019s historic past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Performed by local Shanghai actors, the dialect\u2019s lilting tones echo like whispers from the depths of the courtyards, sketching fragments of bygone tales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059820/extras/cb8313942baa147a16422633e9a18327.avif?t=1760156091\" width=600 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles are like piecing together lost fragments. Through searching old belongings and listening to hushed voices, the story quietly takes shape. No demanding brain-teasers\u2014just a haunting journey into the uncanny past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>In the demo, you will enter Luchang Apartment in advance and experience the beginning of the story.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The full version will feature the complete storyline.</i></strong></p>","developers":["\u5305\u5305\u4e01STUDIO"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3870140","name":"Cat carried Butterfly"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059820/09e83fcf020986e24d2959de0120b1f4377fc533/header.jpg?t=1760156091","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4059820/1025097286/3bfab02cfa900599e669966673d130e37078f560/1760153023/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760154608","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4059820/1025097286/3bfab02cfa900599e669966673d130e37078f560/1760153023/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760154608","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4059820/1025097286/3bfab02cfa900599e669966673d130e37078f560/1760153023/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760154608","id":257215923,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257215923/movie480.mp4?t=1760154608","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257215923/movie_max.mp4?t=1760154608"},"name":"Cat carried Butterfly","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257215923/c8167d33816a6aa3269132b5571b62a56c79